    <param name="&lt;T&gt;&lt;T&gt;">Represents the type of the value that is associated with this identifier.</param>
    <summary>Represents a type safe identifier for a policy.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents a type safe identifier for a policy. Use it as a key for setPolicy and related APIs.</para>
      <code lang="text/java">{@literal @}TypePolicyDefinition
private static final PolicyIdentifier&lt;Type&gt; POLICY_NAME =
    new SimplePolicyIdentifier&lt;&gt;("POLICY_NAME");</code>
      <para>Currently policy definitions are restricted to the android.app.admin.policy namespace. This restriction might be lifted in the future.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/admin/PolicyIdentifier" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.admin.PolicyIdentifier</code>.</a></format></para>
